WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.466
When we focus on our productivity,

00:00:02.466 --> 00:00:06.144
we&nbsp;highlight what we have 
to do to feel worthy,

00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:09.750
rather than who we get to be, where&nbsp;
worthiness is our birthright

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.000
and we are human.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.106
We're human.

00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:19.626
Messily, magically, fantastically,

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:23.051
beautifully, briefly, perfectly human.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.582
Now humans are meaning-making machines.

00:00:26.582 --> 00:00:29.840
We can make a&nbsp;story out of 
anything and make it sound good.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:35.056
So why not then make meaning 
out of the magic&nbsp;of the mundane?

00:00:35.896 --> 00:00:38.948
And absolve ourselves of the responsibility 

00:00:38.948 --> 00:00:41.821
of trying to have some grand&nbsp;life purpose?

00:00:42.445 --> 00:00:45.697
Why not just give ourselves 
permission to be fully human,

00:00:45.697 --> 00:00:47.100
to be fallible,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.460
to be messy,

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.509
to be here while we're here?

